<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>RainHarvest Calculator</title>
<meta name="description" content="Free rainwater harvesting calculator. Estimate how many litres your rooftop can collect, tank size, recharge pit and savings.">
